    "physical_description": "Dagger and sheath<i> badek</i>; the dagger has a single-edged blade that curves down to broaden towards the tip, while the top is straight, rather like a<i> parang.</i> The horn grip is pistol-shaped with a chased silver frame. The sheath is of wood, with a chased silver chape and two chased bands of silver; the top of the sheath has a lightly curved extension in the direction of the grip. ",
